From b54d90e3f7cae7879e2c7fffa1cb668989a48cdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:04:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] button prompts at the window's resolution

gs_texpacks records where each composed texture's icons and prompt words went; paraLLEl-GS reports the sprites that draw them (replaced_sprite), and the presentation draws each one again from its image file (mipmapped), where the picture shows it as the GS drew it.
---
